  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. Two argparse fixes in cli.py main(): (1) typo-detection for invalid subcommands with difflib.get_close_matches Did-you-mean line and exit 2; (2) --debug stripped from argv before parse_args so it works in any position. 9 unit tests cover both bug paths plus their inverse cases (paths still routed to default sketch, --debug actually triggers logging.basicConfig)."  # 9144
